# Antico Baglio Siciliano

SvelteKit **adapter-static** rebuild of the holiday rental site. GH Pages: `rednaw.github.io/anticobagliosiciliano/` until the custom domain `anticobagliosiciliano.it` is cut over. Public site is Italian `/` and English `/en/`.

Open **this folder** → Reopen in Container. Host needs Docker + Cursor, not Node.

Owner archive under `archive/` is not deployed. Domain invariants (occupancy, theme, mailto, …) are glob rules in `.cursor/rules/`.
